#: ../../talk/appearance.rst:3
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "Udseende"

#: ../../talk/appearance.rst:6
msgid "Compact view of conversations list"
msgstr "Kompakt samtaleliste"

#: ../../talk/appearance.rst:8
msgid ""
"Compact view hides last message preview in the conversation list, providing "
"a more focused interface."
msgstr ""
"Den kompakte visning skjuler eksemplet på den seneste besked i "
"samtalelisten, så brugerfladen bliver mere fokuseret."

#: ../../talk/appearance.rst:14
msgid "Chat messages"
msgstr "Chatbeskeder"

#: ../../talk/appearance.rst:16
msgid ""
"Chat appearance settings allow you to customize the look of your "
"conversation chats. You can choose between classic list or message bubbles, "
"with your own messages on the side."
msgstr ""
"Med indstillingerne for chattens udseende kan du tilpasse, hvordan dine "
"samtaler ser ud. Du kan vælge mellem en klassisk liste og beskedbobler, hvor"
" dine egne beskeder står i siden."

#: ../../talk/appearance.rst:19
msgid ""
"You can change both settings from the ``Talk settings`` dialog in the "
"``Appearance`` section."
msgstr ""
"Begge indstillinger ændrer du i dialogen ``App-indstillinger`` i afsnittet "
"``Udseende``."
